WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.069
Let's connect a Discord

00:00:02.069 --> 00:00:03.212
bot to Recatch.

00:00:03.512 --> 00:00:05.274
Step one. Create your

00:00:05.274 --> 00:00:07.453
account at recatch.app.

00:00:07.523 --> 00:00:09.360
On the Create your workspace

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.263
screen, enter your name, your

00:00:11.263 --> 00:00:12.838
email, and a password of

00:00:12.838 --> 00:00:14.531
at least 8 characters.

00:00:14.601 --> 00:00:16.084
Then click Create account.

00:00:16.384 --> 00:00:17.397
Step two. You land

00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:18.942
on the Channels screen.

00:00:19.012 --> 00:00:21.337
Under Connect a channel, click Discord.

00:00:21.407 --> 00:00:22.925
If you see Add to Discord,

00:00:22.925 --> 00:00:25.087
that's the one-click option. To paste

00:00:25.087 --> 00:00:26.780
a token instead, click Use my

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.432
own Discord bot instead.

00:00:28.732 --> 00:00:31.085
Step three. In the Discord Developer

00:00:31.085 --> 00:00:33.698
Portal, create an application, open Bot,

00:00:33.698 --> 00:00:35.190
and copy the token.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.723
People message the bot in a

00:00:36.723 --> 00:00:38.079
DM, so they need a server

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:39.305
in common with it.

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:41.613
Invite it with the bot scope,

00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:44.024
from OAuth2 → URL Generator.

00:00:44.094 --> 00:00:45.952
This token is a fake example.

00:00:45.952 --> 00:00:48.252
Never share your real bot token.

00:00:48.552 --> 00:00:50.136
Step four. Paste the token

00:00:50.136 --> 00:00:51.909
into the Bot token field.

00:00:52.209 --> 00:00:54.463
Step five. Click Connect bot.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.911
Recatch holds a live connection to

00:00:56.911 --> 00:00:58.744
Discord with the token, so no

00:00:58.744 --> 00:01:01.016
webhook or public URL is needed.

00:01:01.316 --> 00:01:03.416
That's it. Discord is connected.

00:01:03.486 --> 00:01:05.239
Next, build your first flow,

00:01:05.239 --> 00:01:07.304
from the lead-capture template or

00:01:07.304 --> 00:01:08.493
a blank canvas.
